(1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3802e511bf473f8cEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0044cc70717e9674END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_PulpCityWatch</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_PulpCityWatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_PulpCityWatch\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">23464c28-a23c-4d9f-9ca9-18e694ea7fb8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23464c28-a23c-4d9f-9ca9-18e694ea7fb8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23464c28-a23c-4d9f-9ca9-18e694ea7fb8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress'</a> barracks at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-11&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;232</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The pages contain an elaborately illustrated story about a fictitious vigilante Flaming Fist called 'The Fixer' thwarting criminal schemes in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>'About time you showed up,' The Fixer growled. His voice was like an ogre's footsteps on Lower City gravel: harsh, hostile, and wholly unmistakeable.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The figure stepped forward. Another member of the Fist, an elf known only as Ghost - a master of stealth, forever one step ahead yet ten leaps behind. His left eye was missing; his right eye was haunted by horrors that would leave an ordinary thief raving mad.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>'Don't act like I kept you waiting,' Ghost whispered. '<a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">The Guild's</a> nabbed <a href=\"/wiki/Alia_Durinbold\" title=\"Alia Durinbold\">Lady Durinbold's</a> daughter. Word from the inside is <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nine-Fingers\">Nine-Fingers</a> demanded ransom - and she's planning on just returning the girl's head when <a href=\"/wiki/Durinbold_Mausoleum\" title=\"Durinbold Mausoleum\">Durinbold</a> forks the gold over.'\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The Fixer nodded, his eyes ablaze with a fire that would have scorched even an archdevil. 'Let's pay them a little visit', he said, a hint of a sadistic smile playing on his lips.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214522\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33326/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10724/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928278/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.910      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.910      1 -total\n 56.48%   26.496      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.18%   23.538     17 Template:Trim\n 22.18%   10.405      2 Template:Uid\n 14.97%    7.023      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.74%    6.915      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.30%    5.769      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.88%    5.571      1 Template:Ifexist\n 11.49%    5.390      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12451-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214522 and revision id 364898. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}